<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, padding: 0, flexDirection: 'column', background: '#FFFFFF' }}>
    <Box style={{ width: 1280, height: 6, background: '#1E4FA8' }} />
    <Box style={{ width: 1280, height: 78, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between', padding: '0 40', borderBottom: '1px solid #D6DCE5' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 32, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C' }}>17 种设备：每种都有专属语义面板</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8', letterSpacing: 3 }}>主讲 · B · 后端业务</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ flex: 1, padding: '18px 40px 12px 40px', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 14 }}>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 14, flex: 1 }}>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderRadius: 12, padding: '14px 20px' }}>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 10, marginBottom: 8 }}>
                    <FAIcon name='lightbulb' style={{ fill: '#1E4FA8', width: 26, height: 26 }} />
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 23, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>光与气候</Text>
                </Box>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.55 }}>灯（亮度 · 三档色温）、空调（5 模式 · 温度 16~30 · 风速扫风）、窗帘（开合度 0~100 + 快捷档）</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderRadius: 12, padding: '14px 20px' }}>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 10, marginBottom: 8 }}>
                    <FAIcon name='fan' style={{ fill: '#1E4FA8', width: 26, height: 26 }} />
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 23, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>厨卫家电</Text>
                </Box>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.55 }}>油烟机（风量档 0~3 · 照明）、热水器（出水 35~65℃）、净水器（滤芯寿命）、智能马桶（座温 · 除臭 · 夜灯 · 离座冲水）</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderRadius: 12, padding: '14px 20px' }}>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 10, marginBottom: 8 }}>
                    <FAIcon name='robot' style={{ fill: '#1E4FA8', width: 26, height: 26 }} />
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 23, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>清洁家电</Text>
                </Box>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.55 }}>洗衣机 / 烘干机（模式 · 剩余分钟每分钟倒计时自动结束）、扫地机器人（清扫模式 · 电量模拟耗电与回充）</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 14, flex: 1 }}>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderRadius: 12, padding: '14px 20px' }}>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 10, marginBottom: 8 }}>
                    <FAIcon name='shield' style={{ fill: '#1E4FA8', width: 26, height: 26 }} />
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 23, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>安防感知</Text>
                </Box>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.55 }}>烟雾传感器（浓度同步房间环境）、智能门禁（上锁 / 开锁 / 常开，上锁=反向语义）、厨房燃气单独判定</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderRadius: 12, padding: '14px 20px' }}>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 10, marginBottom: 8 }}>
                    <FAIcon name='tv' style={{ fill: '#1E4FA8', width: 26, height: 26 }} />
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 23, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>影音生活</Text>
                </Box>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.55 }}>电视（音量滑杆 · 5 种信号源）、投影器（影院 / 标准 / 省电模式 · 音量）、冰箱（冷藏温度 2~8℃）</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderRadius: 12, padding: '14px 20px' }}>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 10, marginBottom: 8 }}>
                    <FAIcon name='tint' style={{ fill: '#1E4FA8', width: 26, height: 26 }} />
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 23, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>水与电</Text>
                </Box>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.55 }}>浇花水泵（立即 / 定时浇水，水量按分钟消耗推算）、插座（开关 + 后端实时功率与累计用电计量）</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ height: 72, background: '#0E3F8C', borderRadius: 12, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', padding: '0 28px', gap: 14 }}>
            <FAIcon name='clock' style={{ fill: '#FFC107', width: 26, height: 26 }} />
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#FFFFFF', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>17 种设备共用同一套 control 接口与语义字段协议：前端加面板、后端加白名单，互不牵连——这正是分工能均衡推进的原因。</Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ width: 1280, height: 58, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between', padding: '0 40' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8' }}>智慧家居 App（仿米家）· 课程结项答辩</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>12 / 24</Text>
    </Box>
</Slide>
